### New word for me
-Sequential scan - scan lahat sequentially
-Index - nagpapabilis dahil inaallow nya ang engine to scan specifilly
-selectivity - example customerId, very selective sya kasi bawat isa ay may pagkakakilanlan at madaling gamitin for locator ng data

